<item>
            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-815] Ledger fence state is lost when the ledger file is evicted</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-815</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;we observed in our use case that when a ledger file is evicted before flushing. the fence state isn&apos;t persisted to disk, which would cause fencing doesn&apos;t work correctly.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12759347">BOOKKEEPER-815</key>
            <summary>Ledger fence state is lost when the ledger file is evicted</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
